SwordMan 0186: rumble never holds on Android; AAudio xruns in the log.

Issues #8 and #28: the guest leaves ramps at a low nonzero value and SDL resent it every 2 s, so the motor never stopped
(measured on the RP5, 01/11: amplitude 0.35 for over 8 s with nothing happening). Crackling with 0 underruns at the game's
stream needs the driver's xrun count, now logged every 10 s when it changes.

